<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰχν-εύμων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tracker</i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> an Egyptian animal of the weasel-kind, <i>which hunts
				out</i> crocodile's eggs (asp's eggs,<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				6.38
			</span></i>), <i>Herpestes ichneumon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				612a16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				107.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				190
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.966d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.904
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχνευτής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a small kind
			of wasp, <i>that hunts</i> spiders, <i>Pelopaeus spirifex</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				552b26
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				609a5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				10.204
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a bird, <i><span class="en">
				Ant.Lib.
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
